#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
GitHub test 2/3 — zero-bandwidth degree-15 global bracket + KKT isolation.

This single file consolidates:
  * exact rational Sturm boundedness for the zero-bandwidth witness;
  * exact LOCAL LP/Farkas ledger replay (522 leaves);
  * exact EXTERIOR LP/Farkas replay (4862 leaves, including 52 refined leaves);
  * rigorous global Bell bracket at K=I_8;
  * directed Krawczyk isolation of the continued 16-variable KKT stationary point.

Run:
    python test_02_zero_bandwidth_global.py

Optional pytest:
    pytest -q test_02_zero_bandwidth_global.py

Dependencies:
    Python 3.10+
    mpmath   (only for the directed Krawczyk interval-isolation test)

All exact ledger data is compressed and embedded. No JSON sidecars are needed.
"""
